Domain Entity OpenStaffPositionEvent
    documentation "Represents significant milestones related to an open staff position."
    date EventDate
        documentation "The date when the open staff position event occurred."
        is part of identity
    descriptor OpenStaffPositionEventType
        documentation "Specifies the type of milestone event."
        is part of identity
    descriptor OpenStaffPositionEventStatus
        documentation "Reflects the status of the milestone event."
        is optional
    domain entity OpenStaffPosition
        documentation "The open staff position associated with the event."
        is part of identity
